morning. It's in the manner of the reprisals, though a very extreme version of the reprisals, which are now becoming common. So the reprisals have almost become institutionalised. The authorities will make reprisals after every, as they see every provocation. Yeah, normally it's localised, it's never on this scale, apart from you could say the burning of Cork was the closest you could get to this. And the second thing is, I mean, it's often described as deliberate and cold

