00:39:40.000 --> 00:40:10.000
how it is presented within history. And for me, the real meaning of Bloody Sunday lies. It doesn't lie in grand historical narratives, but it lies in the personal pain and the trauma of those who were bereaved. How did Jerome O'Leary cope with the death of his young son, who is also called Jerome? He had to go to the Mater Hospital and identify his son. And he simply said he was a schoolboy. How did Bridgett Robinson cope with having to go on a Sunday evening the matter hospital and identify his son. And he simply said he was a schoolboy.

78
00:40:10.000 --> 00:40:44.000
